{
  "description": "Analysis settings of the validated method: tuned on 485 Precursor Genome scans (Nov 2026), checked once on 200 locked test scans (36.0 % exact phases, 49.5 % right compounds). Use with the COD-derived database, Cu Ka and the sample's precursor/target chemistry.",
  "settings": {
